config AMLOGIC_FW_ANTIROLLBACK
	tristate "Amlogic Meson Firmware Anti-rollback support"
	default n
	help
	  This driver provides kernel-side support for the Firmware Anti-rollback
	  checked and updated on Amlogic Meson SoCs.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. the
	  module will be called meson-fw-antirollback.

	  If unsure, say Y.
